          "paragraphs": [
            "例 2 用符号“∈”或“∉”填空：",
            "(1) 0____N; (2) 1____Z;",
            "(3) √2____Q; (4) -√π____R.",
            "解 (1) 0∈N. (2) 1∈Z. (3) √2∉Q. (4) -√π∈R."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": [
